# Tunnel mode: SPA and backend behind ONE origin (ngrok -> vite dev or preview server -> kinotic-server).
# `pnpm dev:tunnel` serves source modules; `pnpm dev:tunnel:build` serves a production build,
# which is what a slow upstream needs since the tunnel uploads every byte the browser loads.
# Clearing the host makes apiUrl() and Kinotic.connect() resolve same-origin, so the vite
# proxy (vite.config.ts server.proxy) carries /api, /v1 (WebSocket), /.well-known, and /mcp
# to the local kinotic-server.
VITE_KINOTIC_HOST=
VITE_KINOTIC_PORT=
VITE_KINOTIC_USE_SSL=
